# scripts/icalfa_feasibility/ is a one-off feasibility spike: a full venv, a
# pixi/podman install, and downloaded ollama models. `venv_*/` above already
# covers venv_icalfa/, but the other two (~950MB combined) were untracked-yet-
# NOT-ignored -- one `git add -A` away from being committed wholesale.
scripts/icalfa_feasibility/ollama_models/
scripts/icalfa_feasibility/podman_pixi/
scripts/icalfa_feasibility/*.log

# Benchmark artifacts: regenerated by every run, and large. Scripts are
# tracked; their outputs are not.
scripts/icalfa_udocker/*.jsonl
scripts/icalfa_udocker/*.log
